          "note": "A03 XSS — PASS. All server-supplied string values interpolated into HTML use escapeHtml() guards throughout knowledge.js. origin_plan is doubly-encoded: encodeURIComponent() in the href attribute and escapeHtml() in the link text (lines 199–200). superseded_by is a numeric type from server JSON and is concatenated directly ('KN-' + ins.superseded_by, line 133) — safe. Inline error messages use escapeHtml(err.message || String(err)) (lines 502, 421, 435, 453). No raw innerHTML writes of unsanitised user input found."
